# Off-host backup settings. Copy to /etc/omniaxis-scdc/backup.env (root, 0600)
# on the server and fill in there. Never put a value in this file, in chat or
# in a screenshot.
#
# The store must be in the US (owner rule: never an Australian region) and
# separate from the server's provider account, so one compromise or outage
# does not take both. Any restic repository works; S3 in us-east-1 shown.
# Give the access key rights on this one bucket only, and turn on the
# bucket's object lock or versioning so a stolen key cannot erase history.

RESTIC_REPOSITORY=s3:https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/BUCKET-NAME/scdc
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-east-1
